{"4121010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Locum Tenens", "steam_appid": 4121010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scientific spaceship Saratorum drifts near the planet Nadalon. An alien craft appears out of nowhere. All attempts at communication fail. Time passes, and crew members, one after another, start to act weird. It was already too late when you gathered your courage and decided to act.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now only your weapon can help you warn your Homeworld about the alien threat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Zero Tolerance and classic retro shooters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 5 inventory slots to manage your equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A wide selection of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Levels that demand different approaches and tools to complete - sometimes speed, sometimes caution, sometimes special gear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bosses and enemies with unique weaknesses and tactics<br>• Cutscenes connecting levels with the storyline<br><br>Originally made for PSP in 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full PC Steam port to modern systems.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scientific spaceship Saratorum drifts near the planet Nadalon. An alien craft appears out of nowhere. All attempts at communication fail. Time passes, and crew members, one after another, start to act weird. It was already too late when you gathered your courage and decided to act.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Now only your weapon can help you warn your Homeworld about the alien threat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Zero Tolerance and classic retro shooters:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 5 inventory slots to manage your equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A wide selection of weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Levels that demand different approaches and tools to complete - sometimes speed, sometimes caution, sometimes special gear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Bosses and enemies with unique weaknesses and tactics<br>• Cutscenes connecting levels with the storyline<br><br>Originally made for PSP in 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full PC Steam port to modern systems.</p>", "short_description": "Originally made for PSP in 2025. Full PC Steam port to modern systems. Variety of enemies, weapons, bosses and levels.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121010/616fb118eba4647a7e070c9cfc834cb3f2094d26/header.jpg?t=1766311006", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121010/fa0139b429e75c266bec124c8f4ba5044cbd8632/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766311006", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121010/fa0139b429e75c266bec124c8f4ba5044cbd8632/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766311006", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Gefore GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Gefore GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></